*
!index.html
!.gitignore
!campaign/
!campaign/**
!community/
!community/**
# The homepage's own files (see build/DEPLOY-FILES.md): its transition stylesheet and script,
# the hero images, favicon and share image, and the webfont with its licence.
!s1-s2-transition.css
!s1-s2-transition.js
!fable/
!fable/favicon.svg
!fable/og-image.jpg
!fable/hero-blur.webp
!fable/hero-v5-final-newlogo-1024.avif
!fable/hero-v5-final-newlogo-1600.avif
!fable/hero-v5-final-newlogo-2048.avif
!fable/hero-v5-final-newlogo-1024.webp
!fable/hero-v5-final-newlogo-1600.webp
!fable/hero-v5-final-newlogo-2048.webp
!fonts/
!fonts/Montserrat-VariableFont_wght.woff2
!fonts/OFL.txt
# The homepage's section stylesheets and scripts (split out of index.html, 6 Oct 2026), and the
# empty .nojekyll that tells GitHub Pages to serve the folder as-is.
!css/
!css/**
!js/
!js/**
!.nojekyll
